    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/quillwork/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The type is the hero — no photograph required. Quillwork is a calligraphy-informed full-site editing theme for independent design studios, named for the precise craft of quill-cut letterforms. A Cormorant Garamond display headline carries the front page on its own, with numbered service cards and a restrained teal/ochre palette. Built on the Colophon core with accessibility in mind — a skip link, visible focus states, landmark roles, and an explicit h1 on every template. Self-hosted SIL OFL fonts, RTL-ready via CSS logical properties, zero plugin dependencies."
    },
